          <a href="roadmap.html" class="text-white underline">Roadmap</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Roadmap</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-3xl">
        Progresso por subprojeto, tal como documentado em
        <a href="https://github.com/DumiJDev/suko/blob/main/ARCHITECTURE.md" class="text-teal-600">ARCHITECTURE.md</a>.
        Cada subprojeto concluído tem uma spec e um plano formais em <code>docs/superpowers/</code>.
      </p>

      <ol class="space-y-4">
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Núcleo da linguagem</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Gramática, AST, SukoAstBuilder, JteEmitter, source map em memória.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Verificador Suko</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">DiagnosticCollector, SukoErrorListener, SymbolTable, SemanticChecker.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Verificação Java</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">JteCompiler orquestra parse → semantic check → JTE emit; JavacTask mapeia erros para .sk.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Integração no build</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Plugin Gradle (sukoCompile/sukoWatch) e plugin Maven (suko:compile), ambos executáveis ponta-a-ponta; nenhum publicado num repositório real.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">5</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Projeto multi-ficheiro</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">package/import resolvidos via ProjectIndex + SukoProjectCompiler; visibilidade public/file-private.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">6</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Modelo de componente</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Component substitui slot&lt;T&gt;; children implícito; interpolação real &#36;&#123;expr&#125;/&#36;ident.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">7</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Registry de componentes</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">suko-components com 8 componentes reais e manifesto gerado (suko-registry).</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">8</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">CLI de distribuição</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">suko init/list/add/diff/update, estilo shadcn/ui — copia código-fonte, não é dependência de biblioteca.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">9</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Unificação da sintaxe de interpolação</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Uma única regra de interpolação em todos os contextos (texto, atributos, strings).</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-teal-300 bg-teal-50 p-6 flex gap-4">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-teal-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center">10</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Site de documentação <span class="text-teal-700 font-normal text-sm">(este site)</span></h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Compilação para HTML estático em build-time, deployável sem JVM em runtime.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 flex gap-4 opacity-60">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-200 text-gray-600 font-bold flex items-center justify-center">11</span>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Suporte de IDE</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Language server (VSCode + IntelliJ) sobre o DiagnosticCollector/SemanticChecker. Por fazer.</p></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </main>

    <footer class="border-t border-gray-200 bg-white py-8">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <p>© 2026 Suko. Documentação gerada com Suko.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
